Package: backup-project-client
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Backup Project <noreply@example.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/PlyusWang/backup-project
Description: Backup Project client (CLI and modern GUI)
 Backup tool client: local archives plus remote backup to a Backup
 Project server (BPNET1 over BPSEC1, optional BPSEC2 signed server
 identity).
 .
 The package ships backupctl (CLI) and backup-project (Qt Quick GUI)
 together with the Qt runtime and QML modules the GUI needs, installed
 under /usr/lib/backup-project-client/. No Qt development packages are
 required on the target machine.
 .
 Installing, upgrading and removing this package never touches user
 data: configuration, caches and backups under $HOME are left alone.
